  id: ear_discord
  displayName: Discord
  description: 'Whisper into the ear of the foe nearest your aim. For five seconds it hears its master in the wrong place and turns on the nearest of its own - and they answer it. The great ones will not be fooled: they falter for a moment and take 20% more damage. The Ear mantras are attuned together: they take all three sockets.'
